The histogram shows the distribution of $X$, the number of tickets sold at a booth in one hour.
Is $X$ uniformly distributed?
Explain.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,4.4);
\draw[->] (0,0)--(8.6,0);
\foreach \y/\lbl in {1/0.1,2/0.2,3/0.3} {\draw (-0.2,\y)--(0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.2,\y) {$\lbl$};}
\node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.2,0) {$0$};
\draw (0.75,0) rectangle (2.25,2.5);
\draw (2.55,0) rectangle (4.05,2.5);
